          "docs": "Update an existing form template. All fields are optional — only provided fields are updated. `formLayouts` is optional — omit it to leave the existing layout untouched.\n\n**formLayouts replacement:** When provided, the `formLayouts` array **fully replaces** all layout groups and their fields on the template. Position is determined by array order.\n\n**IDs are not stable across updates.** Every update internally deletes all existing layout rows and inserts new ones, so every group and field receive"
